<title>JAPAN: Marubeni may issue bond, market sources say.</title>
<headline>Marubeni may issue bond, market sources say.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marubeni Corp is considering raising funds by issuing a bond, several market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company will likely issue a convertible bond worth 100 billion yen to raise operational funds, a market source said.</p>
<p>The company's board will likely approve the bond issue as early as the end of this week or the beginning of next week, another market source said.</p>
<p>A Marubeni official said the company would not comment.</p>
</text>
